{"formula_id": "formula.trig.sine-addition", "name_ko": "사인 덧셈정리", "family": "삼각공식", "latex": "\\sin(a+b) = \\sin a \\cos b + \\cos a \\sin b", "dsl": "sin(a + b) == sin(a)*cos(b) + cos(a)*sin(b)", "standard_codes": ["12미적I-02-01"], "constraints": [], "mnemonic": "신코코신 — sin·cos + cos·sin (부호 그대로)"}
